          "settings": {
            "label": "Deposit and payment",
            "body": "<p>All services require a non-refundable <strong>£30</strong> deposit to confirm your appointment. The remaining balance is due in cash on the day. There are no refunds once the service is complete. If something is wrong with your hair, contact us within <strong>48 hours</strong> and we will put it right.</p>"
