          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Cancelling or rescheduling",
            "body": "<p>You can reschedule or cancel up to <strong>48 hours</strong> before your appointment. Bookings made within 48 hours, or on a day we are normally closed, carry a <strong>£35</strong> emergency booking charge. Working bank holidays also carry a <strong>£35</strong> charge.</p>"
