          "settings": {
            "label": "Arriving late",
            "body": "<p>Arriving more than <strong>15 minutes</strong> late adds a <strong>£15</strong> late fee. Arriving more than <strong>30 minutes</strong> late means the appointment is cancelled.</p>"
          }
        },
        "panel_Bx6FNL": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "How to arrive",
            "body": "<p>Please come with your hair in <strong>8 to 12</strong> neat cornrows so the unit lays flat and finishes seamlessly. If you need a braid down, select it as an add-on before booking rather than on the day.</p><p>If you bought your unit from us, book under \"Unit Purchased from Us\" and allow at least <strong>7 working days</strong> between your order date and your appointment so your unit can arrive and be prepared. You will get a confirmation email once your order and booking are both in.</p><p>If you are sending or dropping off hair, it needs to reach us at least <strong>7 days</strong> before your appointment. Less than <strong>5 days</strong> before adds a <strong>£15</strong> late fee, and less than <strong>2 days</strong> before is treated as an emergency booking at <strong>£35</strong> or the appointment may be cancelled. Drop off is at the same place as your appointment, so message us or check our Instagram story for times, and confirm the postage address with us first as it is different.</p>"
          }
        },
        "panel_HQ3QLX": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Your unit",
            "body": "<p>We only accept <strong>13x6</strong> HD frontals for frontal wig installations. If your head size is <strong>20 inches</strong> or smaller, a <strong>13x4</strong> HD frontal is fine.</p><p>If you are buying a ready-made factory wig, make sure the vendor supplies a full frontal wig and not a \"lace front\", as lace fronts restrict you to a middle part. Thick knots or thick lace are <strong>not accepted</strong>.</p><p>Please check your unit comfortably covers your hairline, as we cannot install a unit that is too small. Units that do not fit will not be installed. If you are unsure, send us a video before your appointment and we will confirm.</p>"
          }
